<title>USA: NYSE says KCS won't comment on activity.</title>
<headline>NYSE says KCS won't comment on activity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Tuesday that KCS Energy Inc would not comment on the unusual market activity of its stock.</p>
<p>By Tuesday afternoon, the company's stock had dropped more than four points to 38-3/8.</p>
<p>NYSE said in a statement that KCS would not disclose if there were any corporate developments that could explain the activity, maintaining that it is company policy &quot;not to comment on unusual market activity or rumors.&quot;</p>
</text>
